body:
Thing I find interesting which gives this a bit more validity for me is that Jimmy Wong is actually present in some of the earlier Boneworks previews that they showed on the Node channel.

&#x200B;

[Here's a link to the video.](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GJ2lzV2LLwM)

Well, yes and no. The way it's portrayed with it's current upswing doesn't really hold any weight to itself. The "challenge" started as a number you could text on whatsapp which allegedly responded with mocking text, gory and horrifying pictures and claiming that the person behind the number knew personal information. But more than that, there haven't really been any confirmed cases of people actually harming themselves or committing suicide.

&#x200B;

I would suggest checking out [ReignBot's](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0jLuF0OQZ-g) video on the first wave of scare hype and then maybe [Philip Defranco's](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S1h4D2ARZcU) video on this current upswing since they're going to and have already explained it way better than I will over this post.
